findmax (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Move sources under src/ and align packaging with zephyr Meson layout.
  * Build man pages from docs/*.adoc via asciidoctor.
  * Switch license metadata to AGPL-3.0-or-later and add bas-c logger support.

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Sat, 12 Sep 2026 08:47:00 +0800

findmax (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Fast file finding utility optimized for O(1) queries
  * Support for multiple sort criteria (time, size, name)
  * Recursive directory traversal with depth limits
  * Custom output formatting with stat-like specifiers
  * Symbolic link dereference support
  * Bash completion support
  * Shared library for integration with other applications
  * Comprehensive man page and documentation

 -- Lenik (谢继雷) <lenik@bodz.net>  Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
